## Example for running script
run

## Directories

./---                  :  synthesis running script
    |
    |
    |-- Constraint     :  constraints & synthesis script for moon_top
    |
    |-- Report         :  Violation, Timing, Area Report
    |
    |-- Log            :  Log files
    |
    |-- Budget_Result  :  Sub-Module Budgeted Timing
    |
    |-- Netlist        :  Gate Netlist
    |
    |-- db             :  synopsys DB
    |
    |-- WORK           :  synopsys design library

## Variables
 User should designate new name for variables in .synopsys_dc.setup file

 - Designer Name     : Designer Name
 - Company Name      : Company Name
 - SYNOPSYS_PATH     : path of installed synopsys tool
 - SYNOPSYS_LIB_PATH : path of synopsys db
 - SYNOPSYS_DB_NAME  : synopsys DB name

 
